        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony D'Amario, Pierre Morel, Luc Besson\n- Works: District 13, Banlieue 13, B13\n- Roles: K2\n\nFacts:\n- Tony D'Amario was born on 28 May 1961.\n- District 13, also titled Banlieue 13 or B13, is a 2004 French action film.\n- Pierre Morel directed District 13.\n- Luc Besson wrote and produced District 13.\n- Tony D'Amario was a French actor.\n- Tony D'Amario was best known for playing K2 in Banlieue 13.\n- Tony D'Amario died in Paris on 29 June 2005.",
